detours provides:

    find_path(DETOURS_INCLUDE_DIRS "detours/detours.h")
    find_library(DETOURS_LIBRARY detours REQUIRED)

This overlay port (Linux/macOS-host cross-compile only) builds detours
from source via a small CMakeLists.txt instead of the upstream NMake
makefile (src/Makefile), since `vcpkg_build_nmake` needs a real
nmake.exe that an xwin sysroot does not provide. It compiles the same
source-file set the upstream makefile does.
